<h1>Construct_Point</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> &#160;Creates new datum point.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Parameters:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Name</b></i></span> – name of the resulting datum point that will be created.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>X</b></i></span> – type the value for the X co-ordinate of the datum point.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Y</b></i></span> - type the value for the Y co-ordinate of the datum point</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic;"><i><b>Z</b></i></span> - type the value for the Z co-ordinate of the datum point</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">For all parameters no default value is available.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span><i style="font-style:italic;">Datuming &gt; Point (Interactive point definition</i> <span style="font-style:normal;">method /input co-ordinates</span><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>)</i></span></span> from the main menu or <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Datuming &gt; Non-interactive &gt; Co-ordinates</i></span> from the main menu.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Construct_Point( Name="Point 1", X=100, Y=100, Z=200)</p>
